cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AgentLoopGate, please cite the software and its accompanying technical report when available."
title: "AgentLoopGate: Evidence-Governed Evolution and Release Control for Agent Harnesses"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "JiaoyangLi"
    email: "jiaoyanglifly@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jiaoyangli-shadow7day/AgentLoopGate"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - agent harness
  - evidence governance
  - evaluation
  - release gating
  - DeepSeek Harness
abstract: >-
  AgentLoopGate is a runtime-independent evidence governance and evolution
  decision layer for Agent Harnesses. It preserves host-native traces, binds
  immutable evaluation evidence, and produces auditable SHIP_RECOMMENDED, HOLD,
  or REJECT recommendations without automatic deployment.
